OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and light rain initially
OL,6,Fdown the east coast, which clears
OL,7,Fearly to mid-morning. Otherwise a day
OL,8,Fof sunny spells and a few isolated
OL,9,Flight showers, most of these confined
OL,10,Fwest of a line through Keith and
OL,11,FBallater.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers turning more frequent
OL,14,Fand heavier across Moray and western
OL,15,FAberdeenshire during the evening,
OL,16,Fotherwise outbreaks isolated with few
OL,17,Freaching east coast. Southwest winds
OL,18,Fincreasing across the coasts overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
