OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMost east of A9 dry with
OL,6,Fbest of the brighter spells appearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Scattered showers
OL,8,Fto west of the A9, building in the far
OL,9,Fwest for the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FIsolated
OL,12,Fshowers Sunday morning, then periods
OL,13,Fof rain for afternoon. Most dry on
OL,14,FMonday with showers generally confined
OL,15,Fto the far west. Tuesday turning wet
OL,16,Fand windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
